"""OnionPress tray app for Ubuntu / Linux desktops.

A thin presentation layer around the bash launcher + shared Python ops
(src/onionpress/launcher_ops.py). Polls ~/.onionpress/status.json every
2 seconds and reflects state via the AppIndicator. State changes are
invoked through `/usr/local/bin/onionpress <subcommand>` so the
headless / SSH-only path remains the single source of truth.

The file deliberately stays one module — at ~700 lines it's easier to
audit and ship than a sprawling package. Split if it grows past 1000.
"""

